00:13:30,246 --> 00:13:32,224
Terima kasih.

719
00:13:33,162 --> 00:13:33,404
Mufasa?

720
00:13:34,576 --> 00:13:35,373
Itu sudah cukup.

721
00:13:35,397 --> 00:13:36,374
Mufasa?

722
00:13:36,398 --> 00:13:37,532
Kembali sekarang.

723
00:13:45,565 --> 00:13:46,382
Mufasa, tetap di sana!

724
00:13:46,406 --> 00:13:47,612
Aku datang, Nak.

725
00:14:01,799 --> 00:14:02,676
Ayah!

726
00:14:02,701 --> 00:14:07,218
Mufasa!

727
00:14:10,314 --> 00:14:11,317
Mufasa

728
00:14:12,992 --> 00:14:18,675
Aku akan menangkapmu pada gilirannya, temukan aku
suara, temukan suaraku!

729
00:14:28,201 --> 00:14:31,587
Mufasa, tebing terlalu tinggi untuk Anda
lintasi lagi.

730
00:14:31,619 --> 00:14:32,897
Ayo, mufasa.

731
00:14:32,922 --> 00:14:33,965
Anda bisa melakukan ini.

732
00:14:33,990 --> 00:14:35,835
Temukan suara ibumu.

733
00:14:35,860 --> 00:14:37,771
Dengarkan ayahmu, Mufasa!

734
00:14:37,796 --> 00:14:39,043
Dengarkan kami!

735
00:14:41,752 --> 00:14:43,530
Kapila, dia ada di sana!

736
00:14:43,674 --> 00:14:44,451
Mama!

737
00:14:44,476 --> 00:14:45,363
Dia ada di sana!

738
00:14:45,857 --> 00:14:46,303
Ibu!

739
00:14:46,643 --> 00:14:50,023
Mufasa!

740
00:14:50,048 --> 00:14:52,359
Temukan pijakan Anda, selangkah demi selangkah.

741
00:14:52,384 --> 00:14:53,028
Saya tidak bisa!

742
00:14:53,053 --> 00:14:56,502
Anda bisa melakukan ini, saya di sini.

743
00:16:02,750 --> 00:16:04,397
Mama?

744
00:16:05,515 --> 00:16:06,859
Ayah?

745
00:16:07,843 --> 00:16:08,853
Bisakah kamu mendengarku?

746
00:16:10,420 --> 00:16:11,862
Adakah yang ada di luar sana?

747
00:16:15,224 --> 00:16:16,524
Mama?

748
00:16:18,121 --> 00:16:19,015
Silakan.

749
00:16:23,808 --> 00:16:25,895
Saya takut

750
00:16:28,807 --> 00:16:35,751
The Floodwaters bergabung dengan sungai yang jauh,
membawa mufasa jauh dari ibu dan ayahnya

751
00:16:35,776 --> 00:16:36,327
di luar..

752
00:16:36,352 --> 00:16:37,336
Semua yang dia tahu.

753
00:17:05,896 --> 00:17:06,590
Halo!

754
00:17:06,764 --> 00:17:08,942
Saya Taka, putra seorang barsi.

755
00:17:09,292 --> 00:17:10,336
Siapa namamu?

756
00:17:10,361 --> 00:17:11,013
Mufasa saya tidak diizinkan berbicara

757
00:17:11,620 --> 00:17:16,957
dengan orang luar,
Tapi saya punya

758
00:17:16,982 --> 00:17:17,325
rahasia dan saya benar -benar ingin memberi tahu Anda.

759
00:17:17,714 --> 00:17:18,724
Apa rahasianya?

760
00:17:18,749 --> 00:17:19,793
Saya akan mendapat masalah.

761
00:17:19,818 --> 00:17:21,095
Tolong beri tahu saya.

762
00:17:21,120 --> 00:17:22,832
Uh, aku tidak tahu.

763
00:17:22,857 --> 00:17:23,867
Katakan saja padaku!

764
00:17:23,907 --> 00:17:24,884
Oke.

765
00:17:24,909 --> 00:17:27,429
Anda akan dimakan!

766
00:17:28,472 --> 00:17:30,522
Aku benci rahasia!

767
00:17:32,128 --> 00:17:32,638
Berenang!

768
00:17:32,663 --> 00:17:33,406
Tapi saya tidak bisa!

769
00:17:33,431 --> 00:17:34,375
Anda harus berenang!

770
00:17:34,400 --> 00:17:35,334
Saya tidak tahu caranya!

771
00:17:35,359 --> 00:17:36,436
Baiklah, dagu!

772
00:17:36,461 --> 00:17:38,940
Lalu berjalan di bawah air, sangat cepat!

773
00:17:38,990 --> 00:17:40,034
Saya tidak bisa!

774
00:17:40,058 --> 00:17:41,802
Ayo, kamu bajingan!

775
00:17:41,826 --> 00:17:44,071
Lebih cepat!

776
00:17:44,194 --> 00:17:45,605
Bantu aku, Taka!

777
00:17:45,630 --> 00:17:47,470
Bantu aku!

778
00:17:59,644 --> 00:18:01,379
Saya bilang untuk menunggu saya!

779
00:18:01,379 --> 00:18:02,823
Ini bukan salahku ibu.

780
00:18:02,847 --> 00:18:05,392
Saya turun untuk minum dan melihatnya
melayang.

781
00:18:05,416 --> 00:18:06,994
Saya ingin Anda bertemu mufasa.

782
00:18:07,018 --> 00:18:10,698
Oh, Anda beruntung buaya itu masih muda
dan takut bertarung.

783
00:18:10,722 --> 00:18:11,365
Ayo pergi.

784
00:18:11,389 --> 00:18:13,267
Kami tidak bisa meninggalkannya di sini.

785
00:18:13,291 --> 00:18:14,969
Aturannya adalah aturan, taka.

786
